# Modules that may write files, create directories or set up file logging
# (Checked by persisted_paths_lint.rs.)
#
# Format:  path relative to crates/  |  ceiling  |  why this module may write
#
# The ceiling is the number of non-test lines that match a write marker (see
# WRITE_MARKERS in the lint). Going over it fails the test: new writes must
# take their names and locations from miasma_core::paths, and the ceiling is
# raised in the same commit so a reviewer sees it. An entry that no longer
# matches anything must be removed.

miasma-bridge/src/bridge.rs | 6 | bridge inbox marker/.processed dir, moving imported originals
miasma-bridge/src/index.rs | 1 | append-only BitTorrent info-hash to MID table
miasma-bridge/src/main.rs | 1 | bridge data dir creation (log setup lives in miasma-core logging)
miasma-bridge/src/torrent.rs | 1 | torrent download directory creation
miasma-cli/src/main.rs | 4 | data dir creation, -o output, directed retrieve save
miasma-core/src/config.rs | 4 | config.toml and version stamp writers
